@startuml C4-Dynamic-ScimProvisioning
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false

title Dynamic — SCIM Provisioning from Explore IAM

participant "Explore IAM\nScimTargetClient" as iam <<java>>
participant "ScimSecurityConfig\n@Order(0)" as sec <<java>>
participant "ScimUserController\n/scim/v2/Users" as ctrl <<java>>
participant "ScimAccountService" as svc <<java>>
participant "OwnerErasureService" as erase <<java>>
participant "Feature handlers\nchat · rag · skill · pipeline\nautomation · metrics" as handlers <<java>>
database "H2\naccount · owner data" as db <<db>>

iam -> sec: 1. Request + Bearer (client_credentials iam-scim-outbound)
sec -> sec: 2. Verify IAM JWT; require SCOPE_write:ai_scim\nelse 401 / 403 SCIM Error
sec -> ctrl: 3. Authorized

alt Create
  ctrl -> svc: 4a. POST /Users (externalId = IAM user id, userName, email, displayName)
  svc -> db: 5a. Identity or userName taken? → 409 uniqueness
  svc -> db: 6a. Account.createProvisionedAccount
  ctrl --> iam: 7a. 201 + Location + ETag W/"0"
else Replace / PATCH
  ctrl -> svc: 4b. PUT or PATCH /Users/{id} (If-Match)
  svc -> svc: 5b. Version mismatch → 412\nexternalId change → 400 mutability
  svc -> db: 6b. replaceProfile · deactivateAccount / reactivateAccount
  ctrl --> iam: 7b. 200 + ETag
else Delete
  ctrl -> svc: 4c. DELETE /Users/{id}
  svc -> erase: 5c. eraseAllForOwner(OwnerKey)
  erase -> handlers: 6c. publish OwnerErasureRequestedEvent\n(sync, same transaction)
  handlers -> db: 7c. Each module deletes its own rows\n(ChatSessionsErasedEvent → metrics)
  svc -> db: 8c. Delete Account
  ctrl --> iam: 9c. 204
end

note over iam, db
  Only explore-iam accounts are visible; filters: userName eq / externalId eq.
  Deactivated accounts fail requireActive on sign-in (403 ACCOUNT_INACTIVE).
  Machine tokens (aud contains sub) never create accounts on /api sign-in.
end note

@enduml
